      "y": 10269,
      "name": "Component/Cart gift radio",
      "context": "Visual specification of a native input type=radio with whole-card label, grouped by reward ID. Checked means currently selected and applied, never an unsaved draft. Radio selection applies the gift immediately. First selection adds one $0 gift for this reward ID; later selections atomically replace that same gift, never append a duplicate. No confirmation, edit, update or save action. The checked option and header always match the applied cart selection. Reopen the accordion with the current choice checked. Merely opening or closing does not mutate the cart. Other gift tiers and merchandise totals are unchanged. Keep keyboard focus on the radio while choosing; on failure restore the last applied choice and report the failure inline.",
