          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "QGKy5",
              "name": "Story Left",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Z8T8L",
                  "name": "Kicker",
                  "fill": "$ink-soft",
                  "content": "OUR STORY",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "600",
                  "letterSpacing": 2
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "hAN23",
                  "name": "Heading",
                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "It started at the clubs",
                  "lineHeight": 1.1,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-display",
                  "fontSize": 38,
                  "fontWeight": "800",
                  "letterSpacing": -1
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "qwOUB",
              "name": "Story Right",
              "width": 820,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 20,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "RoWju",
                  "name": "Paragraph 1",
                  "fill": "$ink-soft",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "We started Fencing Club in 2023, after years of visiting clubs, schools, and training halls around the world. Everywhere we went, the same problem: getting proper gear was slow, costly, or a gamble — thin inventory, uneven quality, and prices inflated by long, indirect supply chains.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "NJQ80",
                  "name": "Paragraph 2",
                  "fill": "$ink-soft",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Every visit pointed to one belief: cost and access should never stand between a fencer and the sport.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "GNxl0",
                  "name": "Paragraph 3",
                  "fill": "$ink-soft",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "So we built one dependable, fencing-only shop — gear for every level, sourced direct, priced fairly, and backed by people who fence and answer when you ask.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "J9y5v",
          "name": "Where We Fence",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "fill": "$bg",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 40,
          "padding": [
            88,
            "$pad-x"
          ],
          "children": [
