                          "content": "This Privacy Policy describes how Fencing Club (the \"Site\", \"we\", \"us\", or \"our\") collects, uses, and discloses your personal information when you visit, use our services, or make a purchase from fencing.club (the \"Site\") or otherwise communicate with us regarding the Site (collectively, the \"Services\"). For purposes of this Privacy Policy, \"you\" and \"your\" means you as the user of the Services, whether you are a customer, website visitor, or another individual whose information we have collected pursuant to this Privacy Policy.",
