                      "id": "RI2lZ",
                      "name": "Component/Size chart / Underarm protectors / cm",
                      "context": "Canonical published chart data; sizes selectable horizontally as columns, measurement names as sticky rows. Data preserved exactly. Only selected columns shown; no calculator or recommendations. Shared by page and flyout; choice is display state, not product sizing configuration.",
