    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "REWd1",
      "x": 17374,
      "y": 83100,
      "name": "Docs / Size charts design handoff",
      "context": "Current implementation and design handoff. Theme-base sizing runtime and reusable ui-drawer are implemented; draft content installed in Contoso. Native metaobject URLs. Actual live-content storefront acceptance remains separate from the local fixture.",
      "width": 1700,
      "fill": "$surface",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 24,
      "padding": 32,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "J3Z7D",
          "name": "Size chart handoff title",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Size charts: design handoff",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-display",
          "fontSize": 28,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "yM69F",
          "name": "Purpose and source handoff",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 8,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "ClY9T",
              "name": "Purpose and source heading",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Purpose and source",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 18,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "x1l6PI",
              "name": "Purpose and source details",
              "fill": "$ink-soft",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "A compact sizing reference using the published Fencing Club charts captured from https://fencing.club/pages/size-charts on 2026-09-06. All 13 metric charts and the demonstrated jacket imperial view retain their original values. Approved graphite illustrations remain. Leon Paul informed the selectable side-by-side comparison pattern, not the size data or fit rules.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "OYmqk",
          "name": "Responsive behavior handoff",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 8,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "WtP6r",
              "name": "Responsive behavior heading",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Responsive behavior",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 18,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "BZPrn",
              "name": "Responsive behavior details",
              "fill": "$ink-soft",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Index /pages/size-charts links to native chart pages. Desktop navigation uses monochrome category disclosures; tablet/mobile use Browse size charts. Product drawer shows one assigned chart. One record-derived header: Size chart: {chart title}; no product subtitle or duplicated body title. Units, when supported, precede size selectors. How to measure and Printable measuring tape are separate disclosures without a divider. View full chart is a persistent footer ui-link.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "O0urKz",
          "name": "Comparison rules handoff",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 8,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "VuhF3",
              "name": "Size selection heading",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Size selection",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 18,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "LqBgq",
              "name": "Size selection details",
              "fill": "$ink-soft",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Size buttons toggle compact columns in canonical source order without changing a product variant. First two sizes are selected initially. URL state restores supported selections and units on full pages. Empty selection shows No sizes selected. In drawers only, row dividers extend through unused width without stretching columns or adding data cells. Larger selections scroll with sticky row labels. No recommendation engine or inferred conversion.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "kG19J",
          "name": "Measurement fields handoff",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 8,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "uVy5N",
              "name": "Shared chart record heading",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Shared chart record",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 18,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "icBg9",
              "name": "Shared chart record details",
              "fill": "$ink-soft",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Merchant-owned size_chart references size_chart_entry and measurement_guide metaobjects. A product stores custom.size_chart, one explicit reference. Records own labels, literal measurements, supported units, guide and fit advice. Pages and drawers share size-chart-content.liquid; no duplicate chart values, per-product URLs or assignment inference.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "kCrde",
          "name": "Known source ambiguities handoff",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 8,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "fW8iy",
              "name": "Known source ambiguities heading",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Known source ambiguities",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 18,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "B5tBpi",
              "name": "Known source ambiguities details",
              "fill": "$ink-soft",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Published charts include gaps, overlaps and unit-rounding differences. Keep those values intact and ask the merchant to review inconsistencies; do not silently fill gaps or extrapolate sizes. The interface now supports manual side-by-side comparison only, so no sizing engine or recommendation rules need to be configured.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "kTW5R",
          "name": "Units, accessibility and privacy handoff",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 8,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "u8OmZJ",
              "name": "Units, accessibility and privacy heading",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Units, accessibility and privacy",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 18,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "b3CAvz",
              "name": "Units, accessibility and privacy details",
              "fill": "$ink-soft",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Semantic table and caption provide an accessible chart name. Size toggles expose aria-pressed with44px targets. Unit radios are labelled Measurement units. Native drawer focus stays contained through the closing animation, then returns to the opener; Close, Escape and backdrop taps dismiss. Standard ui-link focus indicators and arrow icons; no red navigation accents. PDF links remain separate32px rows. No body measurements are collected.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "d3YOql",
          "name": "Diagram and motion guidance handoff",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 8,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "bTsXw",
              "name": "Diagram and motion guidance heading",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Diagram and motion guidance",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 18,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Z8ZI6v",
              "name": "Diagram and motion guidance details",
              "fill": "$ink-soft",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Approved graphite illustrations remain capped at280px with their original proportions. Wide pages pair artwork and instructions; narrow pages and drawers stack them. Shared ui-drawer slides the panel and fades its backdrop over250ms with cubic-bezier(.2,0,0,1). Reduced motion skips animation; interrupted transitions reverse from the current position. Header/footer stay visible while the body scrolls. Navigation current chart uses bold text and aria-current, not an arrow.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "pgfxN",
          "name": "Implementation boundary handoff",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 8,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "OMuIA",
              "name": "Implementation boundary heading",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Implementation boundary",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 18,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "e0jmbW",
              "name": "Implementation boundary details",
              "fill": "$ink-soft",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Implemented in packages/fc-theme-base. Native metaobject chart URLs are /pages/size-charts/{handle}; links use chart.system.url. Product drawer header derives from the chart record, not the product title. Footer View full chart preserves selected sizes and units. Missing/invalid assignments hide the trigger. No-JavaScript pages and print retain all values. Contoso content is installed as draft; this design sync does not publish content or modify the live Fencing Club store.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "dk6IY",
          "name": "Measuring tape download integration",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 8,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "VbBH8",
              "name": "Download integration heading",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "content": "Shared measuring-tape downloads",
              "fontFamily": "$font-display",
              "fontSize": 18,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "o4THH",
              "name": "Download integration contract",
              "fill": "$ink-soft",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Theme-base owns the generator, fonts/logo and A4/US Letter assets. Shared wDEYw and measuring-tape-downloads.liquid render an independent, initially closed Printable measuring tape accordion after measuring help. No separator between disclosures. Shared icon-enabled ui-link, no underline at rest; paper formats remain separate32px rows. Drawer footer uses the same link component and stays outside the scrolling content.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
