                  "id": "b9W3hv",
                  "name": "Chest and height proposal artwork",
                  "context": "Review proposal in the approved hand illustration style. One adult fencer standing upright, facing the viewer in a slight three-quarter view, arms relaxed slightly away from torso, bare head and full body visible. Wear a recognizably white FENCING JACKET with a high stand collar, offset side fastening, long sleeves and simple cuffs, plus white fencing breeches ending below the knees, long white socks and understated fencing shoes. Show ONE narrow crimson flexible measuring tape around the fullest chest, just below the armpits, level around the torso; it follows the chest surface and curves around the sides, never across the upper arms. The unseen back of the tape is hidden behind the solid body. One thin crimson double-ended VERTICAL height arrow to the right of the figure, from the standing surface at the feet to the crown of the head. No waist or hip tape. Natural realistic proportions and a quietly rendered face, same light graphite detail as the hand reference. Keep head, feet and entire height arrow clear of the image edges.",
