                  "context": "Review proposal in the approved hand illustration style. One adult fencer standing upright in a gentle three-quarter front view, full head and feet visible, arms held slightly away from the torso. Plain white high-collared fencing jacket with offset fastening, white fencing breeches ending below knees, long socks and fencing shoes. Two separate narrow crimson measuring tapes around the body: the upper tape sits LEVEL around the natural waist; the lower tape sits LEVEL around the widest part of the hips. Clearly separated vertically; each curves naturally around the body surface, unseen rear segment hidden. They do not cross the arms, hands or crotch. The upper band must not be on the chest. A thin crimson vertical double-ended height arrow beside the figure goes from floor to crown. Natural body proportions, simple realistic clothing folds, restrained graphite shading. No labels or text.",
