      "name": "Canvas group / Printable measuring tape",
      "width": 2800,
      "fill": "$surface",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 8,
      "padding": 24,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "OTZbq",
          "name": "Print shelf title",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Printable measuring tape",
          "lineHeight": 1.25,
          "fontFamily": "$font-display",
          "fontSize": 32,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "ZD13N",
          "name": "Print shelf description",
          "fill": "$ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "A4 above. US Letter below. Landscape instructions and two cutting sheets: eight 25 cm strips, seven joins, 200 cm.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "KsjA9",
      "x": 15727.889763779527,
      "y": 93884,
      "name": "Docs / Printable tape production notes",
      "context": "Production notes only; not part of either printed PDF. Print sheets are top-level frames at actual PDF-point dimensions.",
      "width": 900,
      "fill": "$surface",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 20,
      "padding": 28,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "hx1m9",
          "name": "Print handoff title",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Tape measure production",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-display",
          "fontSize": 24,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "LuZlD",
          "name": "Paper and scale note",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "TCjAH",
              "name": "Paper and scale heading",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Paper and scale",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "zx2cA",
              "name": "Paper and scale text",
              "fill": "$ink-soft",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "A4 landscape:297 x210mm (841.890 x595.276pt). US Letter landscape:279.4 x215.9mm (792 x612pt). One design unit equals one PDF point. Each format has three pages: instructions, strips1-4, strips5-8. Never fit the tape artwork to another paper size.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "LAFkF",
          "name": "Strip construction note",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "HfgFM",
              "name": "Strip construction heading",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Strip construction",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "CuOAR",
              "name": "Strip construction text",
              "fill": "$ink-soft",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Eight canonical horizontal strips cover0-200cm. Each measured body is250mm long and26mm wide. Strips1-7 have8mm overlap tabs at the right. Strip8 has no tab. Letter sheets reference the same exact A4 strip components; only paper size and placement differ.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "a4iCuA",
          "name": "Joining note",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "drk25",
              "name": "Joining heading",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Joining",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "OE8CX",
              "name": "Joining text",
              "fill": "$ink-soft",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Cut the dashed outlines and retain shaded tabs. Place the next strip over the tab so shared cm endpoints meet exactly. Strip2 starts at25cm where strip1 ends. Join boundaries are25,50,75,100,125,150,175cm. Tabs add no measured length; the finished tape is200cm.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "prGxo",
          "name": "Graduations note",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "qSVsy",
              "name": "Graduations heading",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Graduations",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "BlCwo",
              "name": "Graduations text",
              "fill": "$ink-soft",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Top edge: millimetre ticks and labelled centimetres. Bottom edge:1/8-inch divisions with whole-inch labels. Inches continue globally across strip boundaries. Tick positions are exact; endpoint numerals align inward so they survive cutting without running together. The tape ends at200cm, approximately78.74in.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "jT2u6",
          "name": "Print and export checks note",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "rA0dH",
              "name": "Print and export checks heading",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Print and export checks",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "n53Pct",
              "name": "Print and export checks text",
              "fill": "$ink-soft",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Production PDFs use the landscape MediaBoxes above, embedded Archivo/Inter fonts and vector graduations. PrintScaling=None is set, but printer software can override it. Check the100mm line on both cutting sheets with a rigid ruler; it must be283.4646pt in the file and10cm on paper. Five PDF tests cover tick spacing, joins, readable numerals, margins and fonts. No physical print test has been performed.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "U0VN8",
          "name": "Existing files note",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "nLq4E",
              "name": "Existing files heading",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Existing files",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "B3gwQV",
              "name": "Existing files text",
              "fill": "$ink-soft",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Printable source, licensed fonts and logo now live in packages/fc-theme-base/printables. The generator writes measuring-tape-a4.pdf and measuring-tape-letter.pdf directly into the new theme assets directory. measuring-tape-downloads.liquid is the single shared download block. The source geometry is original Fencing Club artwork; no physical print test has been performed.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
